{"unit_id":"xcisxc29__dsh-qq-plugin#card-zh","repo":"xcisxc29/dsh-qq-plugin","commit":"29cc25d1df556d7ae223c3f09a325140db6bd638","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-plugin 是把 DSH 电脑端会话接到手机 QQ 的官方机器人渠道插件。它通过腾讯 QQ 机器人连接器接收私聊，并把消息交给 DSH 会话，再将助手回复送回 QQ；设置页提供扫码绑定、连接控制和配置管理。用户可在手机上创建、浏览和切换会话，选择模型与推理等级，回答审批或多选问题，并收发图片、语音、视频和文件。较长回复会作为 Markdown 文件发送，agent 也可用工具把本机文件或主动通知推送到 QQ。适合希望离开电脑后继续与本机 DSH 交互的用户；绑定通过手机 QQ 扫码完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:53-90","lib/runtime.js:1195-1428","lib/runtime.js:2243-2300","lib/routes.js:41-139"]}
{"unit_id":"xcisxc29__dsh-qq-plugin#card-en","repo":"xcisxc29/dsh-qq-plugin","commit":"29cc25d1df556d7ae223c3f09a325140db6bd638","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-qq-plugin links desktop DSH with QQ on a phone. It routes private messages and replies, supports session and model controls, approval replies, media and file exchange, and agent notifications. Its settings page handles QR binding and configuration for people using DSH away from their computer.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:53-90","lib/runtime.js:1195-1428","lib/runtime.js:2243-2300","lib/routes.js:41-139"]}
